  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Rural and Remote Education Initiative for Papua Provinces Phase 3</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Program aims to improve early grade learning (EGL) outcomes for all children in the Papua provinces. The end of program outcomes include, teachers and principals use sustainable and inclusive methods for improving the quality of foundational skills; district governments use sustainable tools to develop and implement inclusive strategies and plans to improve foundational skills learning outcomes appropriate to their context; and decision-makers use reliable evidence to scale-up quality education interventions with a focus on promoting gender equality and disability inclusion. The first three years of this investment also covers UNICEF&apos;s education response and recovery efforts to the COVID-19 pandemic through support for safe school reopening and teachers&#x2019; vaccination. The program has expanded its scope to one-year pre-primary school and mainstreaming climate change for the second half of the program.</narrative>
  </description>
